behavior:
  GlyphAtlasBitmapRenderSubmissionPlan joins bitmap run output, dirty/upload commands, clipped draw batches, and GPU draw plan into one renderer-facing contract.
  Visible glyphs produce GPU vertices and draw commands; clipped glyphs keep upload commands without GPU vertices; invalid/oversized sources remain diagnostic-only; same-frame page eviction stays blocked.
